00:04:50,840 --> 00:04:55,720
was able to analyze and be able to demonstrate the lift and drag

74
00:04:55,820 --> 00:04:59,220
that an airfoil surface would experience when exposed

75
00:04:59,320 --> 00:05:01,920
to free stream air.

76
00:05:01,921 --> 00:05:05,420
European engineers grasped this new science and built nine wind

77
00:05:05,520 --> 00:05:09,160
