86
00:05:46,221 --> 00:05:50,340
During the war, the NACA began work on the National Full Scale

87
00:05:50,341 --> 00:05:54,280
Aeronautics Complex in California.

88
00:05:54,281 --> 00:05:58,080
In 1958, when the NACA transformed into what we know

