100
00:06:36,721 --> 00:06:39,960
But by necking down, much like a garden hose

101
00:06:39,961 --> 00:06:43,340
when you're turning the spray nozzle, by a six to one ratio,

102
00:06:43,341 --> 00:06:45,560
we get the air up over 100 miles an hour

103
00:06:45,561 --> 00:06:47,940
by the time it reaches the test section area.

104
00:06:50,580 --> 00:06:53,100
The model support system secures the aircraft

105
00:06:53,101 --> 00:06:55,800
while measuring the test data.

106
00:06:55,801 --> 00:06:59,400
It can measure lift, it can measure drag, it can measure

107
00:06:59,500 --> 00:07:03,400
