00:07:39,641 --> 00:07:42,720
and allows us to rotate the models within the wind tunnel

117
00:07:42,721 --> 00:07:46,580
so that we can get them at different yaw angles.

118
00:07:46,581 --> 00:07:49,260
Underneath the 60-foot diameter turntable

