00:07:49,261 --> 00:07:52,120
is the balance room, where all the measurements are logged

120
00:07:52,121 --> 00:07:55,500
and analyzed. The model supports

121
00:07:55,501 --> 00:07:58,900
that measure the forces on the models are very large

122
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:02,700
and intricate machines that can make very exact measurements.

123
00:08:02,800 --> 00:08:06,780
So it really is a compilation of a whole host of some of the

124
00:08:06,880 --> 00:08:09,740
largest and most exotic machines in the world.

