00:11:24,520 --> 00:11:29,920
This carriage provides five of the six degrees of freedom that the simulator has.

176
00:11:30,380 --> 00:11:35,360
If this is an airplane, this is your roll, this is your pitch, this is your yaw.

177
00:11:36,420 --> 00:11:40,840
This is what we would refer to as lateral and then longitudinal directions.

178
00:11:40,841 --> 00:11:47,840
This actuator as well as this actuator back here provide the roll and the pitch axes.

179
00:11:47,841 --> 00:11:56,840
And as you come around here, this actuator that is laying horizontally actually extends and retracts

180
00:11:56,841 --> 00:12:01,840
