181
00:12:01,841 --> 00:12:06,840
And that gives you the yaw axis that you would have in your airplane.

182
00:12:06,841 --> 00:12:14,940
And then right here on the deck, these two surfaces actually slide with respect to one another back and forth,

183
00:12:15,080 --> 00:12:17,520
